Acceptance criteria:
  - Items can be added to cart from the product listing
  - Quantity can be changed and items removed; cart badge updates in real time
  - Cart contents survive a page refresh
  - Checkout form validates all fields before submission
  - Order summary stays visible and accurate throughout checkout
  - Successful submission lands on a unique order confirmation page
  - Confirmation shows order number, items, address, and total
  - Navigating back after confirmation does not re-submit the order